Add a pedometer (step counter) sensor

The Sensor Core on the ADSP runs Qualcomm's pedometer on the accelerometer and
reports the running step total (sns_pedometer.proto: step event 1028, config event 775,
both sns_step_event { uint32 step_count }). SSCSensorPedometer emits "measurement" with
the total; ssccli --sensor pedometer prints it.

Tested on the F(x)tec Pro1-X (SM6115): 181 steps reported for 170 walked.

